---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在。">
  <section class="not-found container">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / Not found</p>
    <h1>这页暂时<br /><em>还没有被构建。</em></h1>
    <p>地址可能已经改变，也可能只是一个还没写完的想法。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/">回到首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="button button-quiet" href="/posts/">浏览文章 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
